# PDIG MVP02 WorkBuddy Rule

Resume-first:
先读 WORK_STATUS、Git 状态和测试结果。禁止从零重建，禁止覆盖 ZCode 已完成且正确的实现。

Correctness:

- Proposal cannot become Reality without allowed verification.
- File adapters are event_stream.
- Missing observations cannot retire confirmed Reality.
- Different SourceInstances must not share fingerprint namespace.
- Multi-source evidence adds provenance, not certainty.
- No machine inference may set criticality=required.
- DEPMAP_CONTAINER_V1 must remain compatible.

Development:

- never delete/skip tests to make green
- preserve strict TypeScript
- focused test then full regression
- update WORK_STATUS before ending a run

Scope:
Only MVP02 Global Source Abstraction.
Do not implement RealityDrift, IncidentPlan, Browser Discovery, Open Banking, AI/LLM, cloud sync or other backlog work.
